### Health Check
GET http://localhost:8080/health

### Create Post
POST http://localhost:8080/posts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "user-123",
  "content": "Hello World! This is my first post.",
  "mediaUrls": ["http://example.com/image.jpg"]
}

### Get Feed
GET http://localhost:8080/posts/feed?limit=5

### Get Single Post (Replace :postId)
GET http://localhost:8080/posts/:postId

### Like Post (Replace :postId)
POST http://localhost:8080/posts/:postId/like
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "user-456"
}

### Unlike Post (Replace :postId)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/posts/:postId/like?userId=user-456

### Add Comment (Replace :postId)
POST http://localhost:8080/posts/:postId/comments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "user-789",
  "content": "Great post!"
}

### Get Comments (Replace :postId)
GET http://localhost:8080/posts/:postId/comments?limit=5

### Share Post (Replace :postId)
POST http://localhost:8080/posts/:postId/share
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "userId": "user-999"
}
